<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Tough Skin</ansi> mutation

Your skin thickens into layered, leathery hide. Protection comes at
the cost of agility.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Skin
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Common

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderate natural physical armor — your toughened skin absorbs
  some of the force from strikes

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced dexterity — the thickened skin limits fluid
  movement somewhat

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
